sed at $79.75, its first close above the base high of $79.39. Volume that day was 6.3M shares, 0.84x the prior 10-day average of 7.4M. It held, never closing below the level three days running, reached a best close of $85.45, and the chart ends at $78.87.","lesson":"This is an example of a breakout that worked on light volume. The volume rule is a guide, not a law. It tilts the odds, and here the stock beat them."}}